{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117932","id":3460843307,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7OSEcr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117932","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117932.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117932.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117932","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117932/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117932/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117932/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/03d7644d8b2a16471e77d4b7d29bbaab762d9dc5","number":117932,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix crash in `GDScript::prepare_compilation` error message","user":{"login":"M4rchy-S","id":89603088,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjAzMDg4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89603088?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S","html_url":"https://github.com/M4rchy-S","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/M4rchy-S/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\r\nIssue: #117699\r\n_Maintainer edit: Fixes #117699_\r\n\r\n## Technical details\r\nIn prepare_compilation condition checks base.is_null() and then calls its properties.\r\n```\r\nif (base.is_null()) {\r\n     _set_error(vformat(R\"(Could not find class \"%s\" in \"%s\".)\", base->fully_qualified_name, base->path), nullptr);\r\n     return ERR_COMPILATION_FAILED;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe error caused by 'uid://' path handling in GDScript *GDScript::find_class(const String &p_qualified_name), because its function does not support such path properly.\r\nAnd that creates a question: should gdscript allow inheritance from \"uid://[...]\" paths?\r\n\r\nThe PR primary focuses to fix a crash.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","followi